OL,3,GNEWSAHopes cash could save at-risk
OL,4,ABronze Age site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn excavation project at a Bronze Age
OL,7,Fsite could see the area removed from a
OL,8,Fregister of at-risk historical
OL,9,Flocations, the government has said.
OL,11,FAncient remains at Flag Fen
OL,12,Farchaeological park near Peterborough
OL,13,Fare deteriorating because of degrading
OL,14,Fgroundwater levels, according to the
OL,15,FDepartment for Environment, Food and
OL,16,FRural Affairs (Defra).
OL,18,FDefra is providing almost #700,000 to
OL,19,Ffund a dig to uncover the history
OL,20,Fbeneath a 3,500-year-old causeway.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
